0252: test stubs for the calls the local patches add to command_processor/texture

gx_fifo_tests and gx_texture_cache_tests have not linked since 0016 (enhanced lighting), 0009 (EFB
copies to RAM), 0176 (6-bit blending), 0217 (variants), 0250 (copy reclamation) and 0240
(find_pipeline takes the draw's ShaderInfo) added calls into them: the test stubs cover the pre-patch
surface only, so both binaries stopped at the link step and neither suite ran. The stubs are the
disabled form of each call (no device in these tests): enhanced config disabled,
sync_config/note_draw false, set_lights/scene_end no-ops, EFB copy ops empty, current_frame 0,
evict_copy_slots no-op, the accuracy globals zeroed. 204 and 18 tests pass.

